{
  "uid": "talkcal-app",
  "title": "talkcal — Spring app",
  "tags": ["talkcal", "app"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app 開始關機（收到 SIGTERM）",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Commencing graceful shutdown\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Commencing graceful shutdown\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 開始關機（收到 SIGTERM）",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      },
      {
        "name": "app 關機時還有請求沒做完",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Graceful shutdown aborted\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Graceful shutdown aborted\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 關機時還有請求沒做完",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      },
      {
        "name": "app 啟動完成",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "green",
        "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Started Application\"",
        "target": {
          "refId": "Anno",
          "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"Started Application\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        "titleFormat": "app 啟動完成",
        "textFormat": "{{container}}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "請求速率 (req/s)，依狀態碼",
      "description": "sum by (status) rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m])。壓測時看這裡：正常都在 200；一旦冒出 502（llama.cpp 那頭掛/逾時）或 400（送錯），就會多一條線出來。已排除 /actuator/prometheus 自己被抓取的流量，免得蓋過真實請求。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/api/calendar/assistant 延遲 (p95 / p99)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile 從 http_server_requests_seconds_bucket 算出的長尾延遲。⚠️ 需要 application.properties 的 percentiles-histogram=true，app 重啟後才有 buckets、這個 panel 才有資料。平均會把長尾藏起來，壓測要看的就是這條 p99。圖上的小菱形是 exemplar：某個真實請求的耗時，帶著它的 trace id，滑過去點一下就跳到 Tempo 看那個請求每一段花多久。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/calendar/assistant\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/calendar/assistant\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "平均延遲，依 endpoint",
      "description": "rate(sum)/rate(count) —— 每個 endpoint 的平均耗時。/api/calendar/assistant 會明顯比別人高（後面掛著 LLM）。這個不必 histogram 就有；要看長尾還是得靠上面的 p95/p99。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM Heap 使用量",
      "description": "jvm_memory_used_bytes vs jvm_memory_max_bytes（area=heap）。看記憶體吃多少、離上限多遠。壓測時若已用量一路貼近上限、GC 壓不下來，就是另一種瓶頸（跟 llama.cpp 的排隊是不同層的問題）。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "已用"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "模型的熔斷狀態（#44）",
      "description": "GuardedChatModel 的 circuit breaker。綠 = 關著（正常叫模型）；紅 = 打開（模型最近大多失敗或太慢，助理直接回 503 MODEL_UNAVAILABLE，不叫模型）；黃 = 半開（打開 30 秒後放 2 個請求去試，成功就關回來）。門檻和理由在 application.properties 的 talkcal.model.*。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{name=\"chat-model\",state=\"open\"}) * 2 + max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{name=\"chat-model\",state=\"half_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "熔斷"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "關著（正常）",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "半開（試探中）",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "打開（直接拒絕）",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "沒叫模型就擋下的助理請求 (req/s)",
      "description": "熔斷打開時擋下的（回 503 MODEL_UNAVAILABLE），以及同時等模型的已滿、bulkhead 擋下的（回 503 MODEL_BUSY）。這些請求幾毫秒就回，不佔執行緒；行程 CRUD 不經過模型，不會出現在這裡。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_not_permitted_calls_total{name=\"chat-model\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "熔斷擋下"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(talkcal_model_bulkhead_rejected_total{name=\"chat-model\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "滿載擋下"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "叫模型的失敗率、慢呼叫率（最近 10 次）",
      "description": "circuit breaker 自己算的：最近 10 次叫模型裡失敗、超過 30 秒的比例。任一條過 50% 熔斷就打開。不滿 5 次時 Resilience4j 回 -1（還不判斷），圖上不畫。400／422（請求本身有問題）不算失敗。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_failure_rate{name=\"chat-model\"} >= 0)",
          "legendFormat": "失敗率"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_slow_call_rate{name=\"chat-model\"} >= 0)",
          "legendFormat": "慢呼叫率"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "同時在等模型的請求（bulkhead）",
      "description": "上限 50（Tomcat 200 條執行緒的四分之一）。模型卡住不回時這條會一路爬到上限，之後的助理請求直接回 503 MODEL_BUSY，剩下的執行緒留給行程 CRUD。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_bulkhead_max_allowed_concurrent_calls{name=\"chat-model\"}) - max(resilience4j_bulkhead_available_concurrent_calls{name=\"chat-model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "在等模型"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(resilience4j_bulkhead_max_allowed_concurrent_calls{name=\"chat-model\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
